### Submit a Backup Job
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/backup/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: idemp-req-001
X-Correlation-ID: trace-001

{
  "job_id": "job-001",
  "backup_id": "backup-001",
  "user_id": "user-001",
  "file_id": "file-001",
  "backup_type": "BACKUP",
  "source_path": "/documents/report.pdf",
  "priority": 2,
  "estimated_duration_ms": 10000,
  "preferred_window": "ANY"
}

### List Jobs
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/backup/jobs
X-Correlation-ID: trace-002a

### Get Job Status
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/backup/jobs/job-001
X-Correlation-ID: trace-002

### Cancel Job
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/backup/jobs/job-001/cancel
X-Correlation-ID: trace-002b

### List Workers
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/workers

### Trigger Scheduler (PRIORITY)
POST http://localhost:8081/internal/v1/scheduler/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policy": "PRIORITY",
  "quantum_ms": 2000
}

### Trigger Scheduler (RR)
POST http://localhost:8081/internal/v1/scheduler/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policy": "RR",
  "quantum_ms": 1000
}

### Acquire Lock
POST http://localhost:8081/internal/v1/locks/acquire
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: trace-lock-001

{
  "file_id": "file-001",
  "holder_id": "job-001",
  "lock_mode": "EXCLUSIVE",
  "lease_timeout_ms": 30000
}

### Get Metrics
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/metrics/backup

### Analyse Deadlocks
POST http://localhost:8081/internal/v1/deadlocks/analyse
